</div>
</section>
<section id="S6.SS0.SSS0.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Analysis.</h5>

<div id="S6.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#S6.F4" title="Figure 4 ‣ Analysis. ‣ 6 Empirical Evaluation ‣ Contract-Based Compositional Shielding for Safe Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> shows the shielded and contract-aware reward curves. The plotted quantity is reward: safety is enforced structurally by certified masks and Theorems <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem 4.1 (Circular Compositional Soundness (restated)) ‣ 4.2 Contract Product Shields ‣ 4 Contract Shielding ‣ Contract-Based Compositional Shielding for Safe Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.1</span></a> and <a href="#S5.Thmtheorem2" title="Theorem 5.2 (Safety of Certified Selection (restated)) ‣ 5.3 Bandit Selector ‣ 5 Learning with Contract Shields ‣ Contract-Based Compositional Shielding for Safe Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5.2</span></a>; the curves measure retained return under certified actions. Where ordinary factorised shields are deployable, contract shielding improves reward and converges toward <span id="S6.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Shielded-Joint-PPO</span>. For <span id="S6.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">RWARE</span>, <span id="S6.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Pressure Plate</span>, and <span id="S6.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Connector</span>, the selected global specifications admit no factorised shield because masks must be conservative over other agents’ actions. For <span id="S6.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Pressure Plate</span>, shielded baselines use conservative local runner masks rather than a direct factorisation of <math id="S6.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Phi^{\mathsf{pp}}_{\mathsf{safe}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mi>𝗌𝖺𝖿𝖾</mi><mi>𝗉𝗉</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Phi^{\mathsf{pp}}_{\mathsf{safe}}</annotation></semantics></math> (Appendix <a href="#Pt0.A3.SS1" title="0.C.1 Pressure Plate ‣ Appendix 0.C Environments ‣ Contract-Based Compositional Shielding for Safe Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">0.C.1</span></a>). In the largest environment instances, bounded search considered up to 12,001 profiles and certified up to 390 as safe; Table <a href="#Pt0.A4.T1" title="Table 1 ‣ Appendix 0.D Extended Experimental Results ‣ Contract-Based Compositional Shielding for Safe Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> in Appendix <a href="#Pt0.A4" title="Appendix 0.D Extended Experimental Results ‣ Contract-Based Compositional Shielding for Safe Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">0.D</span></a> gives all objectives and results.</p>
</div>
