<span id="Pt0.A6.T5.2.1.1.1.1.1.7.4" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" style="padding:0.2pt 3.0pt;"><math id="Pt0.A6.T5.m13" class="ltx_Math" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F7F7F7;" alttext="25" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-bg-color:#F7F7F7;" mathbackground="#F7F7F7">25</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">25</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
</span></span></span>
</span></span></span><span id="Pt0.A6.T5.2.2" class="ltx_text"></span></p>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Benchmark run configuration used by the experiments.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="Pt0.A6.SS0.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Policy-gradient settings.</h5>

<div id="Pt0.A6.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A6.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The PPO-family actor-critic settings in Table <a href="#Pt0.A6.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Policy-gradient settings. ‣ Appendix 0.F Hyperparameters ‣ Contract-Based Compositional Shielding for Safe Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>
apply to <span id="Pt0.A6.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">IPPO</span>, <span id="Pt0.A6.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">MAPPO</span>, <span id="Pt0.A6.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Joint-PPO</span>, their shielded variants,
<span id="Pt0.A6.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Contract-IPPO</span>, and <span id="Pt0.A6.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">IPPO-Lagrangian</span>. The optimiser is Adam with
<math id="Pt0.A6.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon=10^{-5}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon=10^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math> and global gradient-norm clipping at <math id="Pt0.A6.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.5</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.5</annotation></semantics></math>; the learning
rate is linearly annealed from <math id="Pt0.A6.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2.5\cdot 10^{-4}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.5</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2.5\cdot 10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math> to zero over training.
<span id="Pt0.A6.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">ICPO</span> is specified separately under the constrained settings below.</p>
</div>
<figure id="Pt0.A6.T6" class="ltx_table">
