<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8: </span>Contract synthesis and selection hyperparameters. “Warmup/dwell” is measured in completed episodes.</figcaption>
