</section>
<section id="Pt0.A6.SS0.SSS0.Px6" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Reported curves.</h5>

<div id="Pt0.A6.SS0.SSS0.Px6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A6.SS0.SSS0.Px6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Reward and safety curves are constructed from completed episode histories. We report the reporting the mean with <math id="Pt0.A6.SS0.SSS0.Px6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="95\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>95</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">95\%</annotation></semantics></math> confidence interval bands.
Smoothing is applied for visualisation purposes, the plots interpolate each curve to <math id="Pt0.A6.SS0.SSS0.Px6.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="800" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>800</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">800</annotation></semantics></math> points and apply a centred moving-average window of width <math id="Pt0.A6.SS0.SSS0.Px6.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="11" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>11</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">11</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
